      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel's packet filtering and NAT framework: hooks, tables, and connection tracking",
      "source_hash": 3211816888911962349,
      "context_hash": 17773771372412669127,
      "translation": "커널의 패킷 필터링 및 NAT 프레임워크: 훅, 테이블, 연결 추적",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hook": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:05.211295Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What Netfilter is",
      "source_hash": 13486402779648712067,
      "context_hash": 8692042226231415569,
      "translation": "Netfilter란 무엇인가",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Netfilter": "Netfilter"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:05.211295Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Netfilter is a framework of hooks embedded at fixed points in the IP stack.",
      "source_hash": 12445449821541205443,
      "context_hash": 10634086269661851540,
      "translation": "Netfilter는 IP 스택의 고정된 지점에 내장된 훅(hook)들로 이루어진 프레임워크입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Netfilter": "Netfilter",
        "hook": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:05.211295Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Every packet traversing the network passes through these hooks, where registered callbacks (from iptables, nftables, conntrack, etc.) can inspect and modify it.",
      "source_hash": 2638325973859377710,
      "context_hash": 8047841120453408413,
      "translation": "네트워크를 통과하는 모든 패킷은 이 훅들을 거치며, 여기서 (iptables, nftables, conntrack 등에서) 등록한 콜백이 패킷을 검사하고 수정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백",
        "conntrack": "conntrack",
        "hook": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:05.211296Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Netfilter itself is just the framework.",
      "source_hash": 15634455517939070828,
      "context_hash": 8321942966902926314,
      "translation": "Netfilter 자체는 프레임워크일 뿐입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Netfilter": "Netfilter"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:05.211296Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The policy (firewall rules, NAT, etc.) is implemented by modules that register at these hooks.",
      "source_hash": 15401696819023570465,
      "context_hash": 8457033766508156667,
      "translation": "정책(방화벽 규칙, NAT 등)은 이 훅들에 등록하는 모듈이 구현합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hook": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:05.211296Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
