      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:17.591266Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Conntrack tuning",
      "source_hash": 11793965881305480432,
      "context_hash": 10214581158627644314,
      "translation": "Conntrack 튜닝",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:17.591266Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "A full conntrack table causes new connections to be dropped.",
      "source_hash": 1181877387152134424,
      "context_hash": 6957416147856105824,
      "translation": "conntrack 테이블이 가득 차면 새 연결이 drop됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:17.591267Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:13/seg:1",
      "source": "This is a common issue on busy NAT gateways or connection-heavy servers.",
      "source_hash": 8970628131179468679,
      "context_hash": 1685220576735919386,
      "translation": "이는 트래픽이 많은 NAT 게이트웨이나 연결이 많은 서버에서 흔히 발생하는 문제입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:17.591267Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "NAT: DNAT and SNAT",
      "source_hash": 17325650702117890516,
      "context_hash": 1611815846852912442,
      "translation": "NAT: DNAT와 SNAT",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:17.591267Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "NAT is implemented as Netfilter hooks that modify packets and store the rewrite in the conntrack entry:",
      "source_hash": 1290989707219851883,
      "context_hash": 11733188540773125458,
      "translation": "NAT는 패킷을 수정하고 그 재작성 내용을 conntrack 엔트리에 저장하는 Netfilter 훅으로 구현됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Netfilter": "Netfilter",
        "conntrack": "conntrack",
        "hook": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:31:28.216792Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The conntrack entry stores both directions, so reply packets are automatically rewritten in the opposite direction (DNAT reply becomes SNAT, etc.) without needing explicit reverse rules.",
      "source_hash": 2274242911522212074,
      "context_hash": 12818905774232589531,
      "translation": "conntrack 항목은 양방향을 모두 저장하므로, 명시적인 역방향 규칙 없이도 응답 패킷이 반대 방향으로 자동으로 재작성됩니다(DNAT의 응답은 SNAT가 되는 식입니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:17.591267Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
